    a: [['Namuna', 'This is my phone. It’s black and its screen is big. That’s my sister’s laptop. Hers is pink. My dad’s car is old, but my uncle’s car is new. Whose bag is this? It isn’t mine!']],
    q: ['Whose phone is the oldest in your family?', 'What’s your favourite thing? Describe it.', 'Is your room yours or do you share it?', 'What’s the name of your best friend’s pet?']
