      x: '<p>Do‘konda: <b>What size are you?</b> — o‘lchamingiz? <b>Can I try it / them on?</b> — kiyib ko‘rsam bo‘ladimi? (jeans → <b>them</b>!). <b>It’s too small</b> — juda kichik. <b>It fits</b> — o‘lchami to‘g‘ri keldi. <b>It suits you</b> — sizga yarashdi.</p>',
