    plan: ['Kafe nomi va qayerda', 'Nimani buyurtma qildingiz (I’d like …)', 'Ta’mi qanday edi', 'a lot of / much / many', 'a few / a little', 'Narx: How much…'],
    model: 'Last week I went to a small café near my school. There aren’t many tables, but there are a lot of customers. I said: «I’d like a chicken wrap and a lemonade, please.» The wrap had a lot of vegetables and a little spicy sauce. It was delicious! There were only a few desserts on the menu. It wasn’t expensive: the bill was fifty thousand. I want to go there again.',
