    a: [['Namuna', 'I usually buy clothes at the market because it’s cheaper than the shopping centre. But the shopping centre is more comfortable and the quality is better. The best place for phones in my city is a small shop near the metro. Online shopping is the easiest, but it isn’t as fast as going to a shop.']],
