    lines: [[0, 'Nodira, I can’t decide. Phone A or phone B?'], [1, 'Well, phone A is cheaper. It’s two million.'], [0, 'And phone B is three million. That’s more expensive.'], [1, 'Yes, but the camera on phone B is much better.'], [0, 'Is the battery bigger too?'], [1, 'No, the batteries are the same. Phone A’s battery is as good as phone B’s.'], [0, 'Which one is the fastest?'], [1, 'Phone B. It’s the fastest phone in the shop. But I think you can’t afford it now.'], [0, 'True. Is there a discount?'], [1, 'Yes! Next week there’s a sale. Phone B will be cheaper then.']],
