    model: 'Dear diary, today was a really exciting day. In the morning I was nervous because we had a football final. Although our team was smaller, we played very well. I scored the first goal, so my friends lifted me up! The second half was tiring, but we won 2–1. In the evening I felt proud and relaxed. My little brother was bored at the match, but he was excited when we won!',
