    a: [['Shifokorda', 'Doctor: What’s the problem? — I’ve got a sore throat and a high temperature. — You must stay in bed for three days and you should drink a lot of warm water. You mustn’t eat ice cream! — Must I go to school? — No, you needn’t. Rest at home.']],
