      ['Now look at this paper on the wall. It’s our [timetable]. What [subjects|subject] do we have? On Monday we have [Maths], [English] and [History]. On Tuesday we have [Geography], [Biology] and [Chemistry].',
       'Endi devordagi mana bu qog‘ozga qarang. Bu — dars jadvalimiz. Qanday fanlarimiz bor? Dushanbada matematika, ingliz tili va tarix. Seshanbada geografiya, biologiya va kimyo.'],
      ['[Physics] is on Wednesday — it’s difficult, but our teacher is great. On Thursday we have [Literature], [Art] and [Music]. Friday is the best day: [PE] and [IT]! In IT we learn to make games.',
       'Fizika chorshanbada — u qiyin, lekin ustozimiz zo‘r. Payshanbada adabiyot, tasviriy san’at va musiqa. Juma — eng yaxshi kun: jismoniy tarbiya va informatika! Informatikada o‘yin yaratishni o‘rganamiz.'],
      ['Those students over there are my friends. Say hello, guys! What’s your favourite subject? Write in the comments. Bye!',
       'Anavi o‘quvchilar — do‘stlarim. Salom deb qo‘yinglar! Sizning sevimli faningiz qaysi? Izohlarda yozing. Xayr!']
