      ['wedding', '/ˈwedɪŋ/', 'to‘y (nikoh)', 'My cousin’s *wedding* is next month.', 'Amakivachchamning to‘yi kelasi oyda.', 'ring'],
      ['anniversary', '/ˌænɪˈvɜːsəri/', 'yubiley, yilligi', 'It’s my parents’ 20th wedding *anniversary*.', 'Bugun ota-onamning to‘yiga 20 yil to‘ldi.', 'red-heart #20'],
      ['party', '/ˈpɑːti/', 'ziyofat, bazm', 'We’re having a *party* on Saturday.', 'Shanba kuni ziyofat qilyapmiz.', 'partying-face'],
      ['graduation', '/ˌɡrædʒuˈeɪʃn/', 'bitiruv kechasi', 'My brother’s *graduation* was in June.', 'Akamning bitiruvi iyunda bo‘ldi.', 'graduation-cap'],
      ['guest', '/ɡest/', 'mehmon', 'We had 300 *guests* at the wedding.', 'To‘yda 300 mehmonimiz bor edi.', 'busts-in-silhouette']
