  vr: [{ h: '-ed yoki -ing?', x: '<p><b>-ed</b> — odam <b>nimani his qilyapti</b>: I’m <b>bored</b>. She was <b>excited</b>.</p><p><b>-ing</b> — narsa yoki holat <b>qanday</b>: The film is <b>boring</b>. The trip was <b>exciting</b>.</p><p>«I’m boring» — «Men zerikarli odamman» degani! Ehtiyot bo‘ling.</p><p>Predloglar: <b>afraid of</b>, <b>worried about</b>, <b>proud of</b>, <b>angry with</b> (odamga).</p>',
    tb: { h: ['-ed (his)', '-ing (sabab)'], r: [['bored', 'boring'], ['excited', 'exciting'], ['embarrassed', 'embarrassing'], ['surprised', 'surprising'], ['confused', 'confusing']] } }],
