      x: '<p><b class="rd">Third Conditional</b> — o‘tmishda <b>bo‘lmagan</b> narsa haqida «agar shunday bo‘lganda edi»: «If I <b>had studied</b>, I <b>would have passed</b>.» (aslida o‘qimadim va o‘tmadim)</p><p>Ikki qism ham <b>V3</b> bilan: <b>had + V3</b> (shart) va <b>would have + V3</b> (natija).</p><p>Qisqartma: <b>had → ’d</b> (If I’<b>d</b> known) va <b>would have → would’ve</b> (I would’ve gone).</p>',
