      x: '<p><b class="rd">must</b> — gapiruvchi o‘zi shunday deb hisoblaydi yoki qat’iy qoida: «I <b>must</b> stop smoking.» <b class="rd">have to</b> — tashqi majburiyat: «I <b>have to</b> take this medicine twice a day.» (shifokor aytgan)</p><p>O‘tmish va kelajak uchun <b>must</b> o‘rniga <b>had to / will have to</b> ishlatiladi: «Yesterday I <b>had to</b> see a doctor.»</p><p>Savol: <b>Do</b> I <b>have to</b> …? (✗ Must I … — juda rasmiy).</p>',
