      x: '<p><b class="rd">should</b> va <b class="rd">ought to</b> — maslahat: «You <b>should</b> drink more water.» Ma’nosi deyarli bir xil.</p><p><b class="rd">had better</b> — kuchliroq maslahat, ko‘pincha agar qilmasangiz yomon bo‘ladi: «You <b>had better</b> see a doctor, or it will get worse.» (had better + V, to yo‘q!)</p><p>Maslahat so‘rash: «What <b>should</b> I do?» «<b>Do you think I should</b> …?»</p>',
