      x: '<p><b class="rd">Can I …?</b> (oddiy), <b class="rd">Could I …?</b> (xushmuomala), <b class="rd">May I …?</b> (rasmiy) — ruxsat so‘rash: «<b>May I</b> leave early?»</p><p><b class="rd">be allowed to</b> — ruxsat etilgan: «Visitors <b>are allowed to</b> enter after 4.» Inkor: <b>aren’t allowed to</b> = mumkin emas.</p><p>O‘tmish: «We <b>weren’t allowed to</b> eat before the operation.» (<b>can</b> o‘rniga <b>be allowed to</b>)</p>',
      key: ['*Can / Could / May* I …? = ruxsat so‘rash', '*be allowed to* = ruxsat etilgan (o‘tmishda ham)'],
