  A: [{
    k: 'Hikoya', t: 'Grandpa’s Surprising Check-up', s: 'Bobosining yillik ko‘rigi kutilmagan xushxabar bilan tugadi',
    p: [
      ['Bobur’s grandfather felt a bit [under the weather|under the weather]. He often felt [dizzy] when he stood up, and sometimes [nauseous]. He would [wheeze] when he climbed the stairs. His left ankle was [swollen] after a fall, and his skin was [itchy] in the evenings. “I think I’m [coming down with|come down with] something,” he said. His family worried because he had a [chronic] cough as well. They decided it was time for a proper [check-up].',
       'Boburning bobosi o‘zini biroz yomon his qilayotgan edi. U o‘rnidan turganda tez-tez boshi aylanar, ba’zan ko‘ngli ayniydi. Yiqilgandan keyin chap oyoq to‘pig‘i shishgan, kechqurunlari esa terisi qichishardi. «Menimcha, nimadir bo‘layapman», dedi u. Oilasi xavotirda edi, chunki uning surunkali yo‘tali ham bor edi. Ular to‘liq tibbiy ko‘rik vaqti kelganiga qaror qilishdi.'],
      ['At the clinic the doctor listened to his chest and asked about every [symptom]. “It could be an [infection], maybe an [allergy],” she said. She worried about his [immune system] and about the [severe] swelling. After a few tests she [diagnosed|diagnose] him and made a [diagnosis]: a minor [infection], nothing [contagious]. He had also [sprained|sprain] his ankle and had a [graze] on his leg. “You must be careful,” she said, “and you should [cut down on|cut down on] salt. Call me [immediately] if the swelling grows.”',
       'Klinikada shifokor ko‘kragini tingladi va har bir belgi haqida so‘radi. «Bu infeksiya, balki allergiya bo‘lishi mumkin», dedi u. U immunitet va kuchli shish haqida xavotirda edi. Bir necha tahlildan keyin tashxis qo‘ydi: yengil infeksiya, yuqumli emas. U oyoq to‘pig‘ini ham g‘ijimlagan va oyog‘ida katta ko‘kargan joy bor edi. «Ehtiyot bo‘lishingiz kerak, — dedi u, — va tuzni kamaytirishingiz lozim.»'],
      ['The doctor wrote a [prescription] and explained the [treatment]. The [injection] was [painful], but the pills had no [side effects|side effect]. For his ankle he needed [physiotherapy]. “Your [recovery] will move [steadily], but you will [recover|recover],” she added. His wife prepared a traditional [remedy] — honey with ginger. “Eat [nutritious] food and stay [in good shape|in good shape],” the doctor advised. “That is [harmless] and good for you,” she said about the honey.',
       'Shifokor retsept yozdi va davolashni tushuntirdi. Ukol og‘riqli edi, lekin tabletkalarning nojo‘ya ta’siri yo‘q edi. Oyog‘i uchun fizioterapiya kerak edi. «Tuzalishingiz asta-sekin bo‘ladi, lekin tuzalasiz», deb qo‘shdi u. Xotini an’anaviy xalq davosi — zanjabilli asal tayyorladi. «To‘yimli ovqat yeng va sog‘lom turing», deb maslahat berdi shifokor. «Bu zararsiz va foydali», dedi u asal haqida.'],
      ['Three months later grandfather came back for the last check. He had stopped eating too much salt, and he walked every morning. “Doctor, I am [back on my feet|back on your feet],” he said proudly. She smiled. “You have [a clean bill of health|a clean bill of health]. You are now [as fit as a fiddle|as fit as a fiddle]!” Bobur laughed. “Grandpa, you must not [faint|faint] from happiness!” And the old man said, “Well, I will never again [feel run down|feel run down].”',
       'Uch oydan keyin bobo oxirgi ko‘rik uchun qaytdi. U ko‘p tuz yeyishni to‘xtatgan va har ertalab yurar edi. «Doktor, men oyoqqa turdim», dedi u g‘urur bilan. U jilmaydi. «Sizda to‘liq sog‘lom degan xulosa bor. Endi siz juda sog‘lomsiz!» Bobur kuldi: «Bobo, xursandchilikdan hushingizdan ketmang!» Chol dedi: «Ha, endi hech qachon holdan toygan bo‘lmayman.»']
    ],
    q: [
      ['How did grandfather feel at first?', ['Dizzy and nauseous', 'Very happy', 'Hungry'], 0],
      ['What was the diagnosis?', ['A minor infection', 'A broken leg', 'Nothing'], 0],
      ['What did he need for his ankle?', ['Physiotherapy', 'An operation', 'A bandage only'], 0],
      ['What did his wife prepare?', ['A traditional remedy', 'Medicine', 'Tea only'], 0],
      ['What did the doctor say at the end?', ['He got a clean bill of health.', 'He must stay in bed.', 'He needs surgery.'], 0]
    ]
  }],
