      ['But a week later she [pulled a muscle|pull a muscle] during training. The injury was serious, and the doctor said she couldn’t [compete|compete] for two months. “I won’t [throw in the towel|throw in the towel],” Ziyoda said. She still went to the gym to work out a little and stretch. Her coach told her to [keep her eye on the ball|keep your eye on the ball]: “[A level playing field|a level playing field] begins with patience.” She stayed [consistently|consistently] positive.',
       'Lekin bir haftadan keyin u mashg‘ulot paytida mushagini cho‘zib oldi. Jarohat jiddiy edi va shifokor ikki oy musobaqalasha olmasligini aytdi. «Men taslim bo‘lmayman», dedi Ziyoda. U hali ham sport zaliga borib biroz shug‘ullandi va cho‘zildi. Murabbiyi unga maqsaddan chalg‘imaslikni aytdi: «Teng sharoit sabrdan boshlanadi.» U barqaror ijobiy kayfiyatda qoldi.'],
      ['Two months later she was back. In the final she [defeated|defeat] the champion and won a gold medal. The tournament ended and the crowd was on its feet. “I was always [on the ball|on the ball],” she laughed. The newspaper wrote that she had not just run — she had taken part in a story. Now Ziyoda coaches young girls herself, and she tells them: “Don’t [move the goalposts|move the goalposts] when it gets hard. Run your own race.”',
       'Ikki oydan keyin u qaytdi. Finalda u chempionni mag‘lub etdi va oltin medal yutdi. Turnir tugadi va olomon oyoqda edi. «Men doim hushyor edim», deb kuldi u. Gazeta u shunchaki yugurmadi, balki hikoyada qatnashdi, deb yozdi. Endi Ziyoda yosh qizlarni o‘zi tayyorlaydi va ularga deydi: «Qiyin bo‘lganda qoidani o‘zgartirmang. O‘z poygangizni yuguring.»'],
      ['Her old [trainer] became her friend. He told her to [loosen up|loosen up] before every [fixture] in the [league], and to [mentor] younger girls. At the end of the [knockout] stage she stood on the [podium] with a [strain] still in her leg. She decided to [hit the gym|hit the gym] and [take part in|take part in] the next event, where [spectators|spectator] and an [umpire] would watch every move.',
       'Uning eski trener do‘sti bo‘lib qoldi. U unga ligadagi har bir o‘yindan oldin mushaklarni bo‘shatib olishni va yosh qizlarga ustozlik qilishni aytdi. Saralash bosqichi oxirida u oyog‘ida cho‘zilgan mushak bilan g‘oliblar maydonchasida turdi. U sport zaliga borishga va keyingi tadbirda qatnashishga qaror qildi, u yerda tomoshabinlar va hakam har bir harakatini kuzatadi.']
