    a: [['Namuna', 'According to the news, a famous actor left the country. He must have gone abroad because his flat is empty. He can’t have left alone — his wife is also missing. Reporters might have followed him, but they should have waited for an official statement. The editor shouldn’t have published the rumour.']],
    q: ['What was the last piece of news you heard?', 'Who do you think could have done it?', 'Should the media always check facts?', 'Where do you get most of your news?']
