      x: '<p><b class="rd">Passive</b> — harakatni kim bajargani muhim emas, <b>nima bajarilgani</b> muhim: «Cars <b>are made</b> in Asaka.» (kim yasaydi — muhim emas)</p><p>Shakl: <b>to be (am / is / are) + V3</b>. Faol: «They <b>make</b> cars.» → Passiv: «Cars <b>are made</b>.»</p><p>Agar bajaruvchini aytmoqchi bo‘lsak: <b class="rd">by</b> + shaxs: «The book <b>is written by</b> Tolkien.»</p>',
      key: ['*am / is / are + V3* (Present Passive)', 'bajaruvchi kerak bo‘lsa → *by* + shaxs'],
      e: [['Cars *are made* in this factory.', 'Mashinalar bu zavodda ishlab chiqariladi.', 'automobile'], ['English *is spoken* all over the world.', 'Ingliz tilida butun dunyoda gaplashiladi.', 'globe-showing-europe-africa'], ['The lab *is cleaned* every day.', 'Laboratoriya har kuni tozalanadi.', 'microscope'], ['*Is* the experiment *done* in this room?', 'Tajriba shu xonada o‘tkaziladimi?', 'test-tube ?'], ['Robots *aren’t used* in our school.', 'Maktabimizda robotlardan foydalanilmaydi.', 'robot'], ['The book *is written by* a scientist.', 'Kitobni olim yozgan.', 'books']],
