    ex: [['Edison was a famous ___ . (ixtirochi)', 'inventor'], ['She tested her ___ in the lab. (faraz)', 'hypothesis'], ['It was a real scientific ___ . (katta yutuq)', 'breakthrough'], ['Old phones are ___ now. (eskirgan)', 'obsolete'], ['He got a ___ for his device. (patent)', 'patent'], ['We learned by ___ and error.', 'trial']]
