      x: '<p>Bu fe’llardan keyin <b class="rd">faqat V-ing</b>: <b>enjoy, mind, avoid, finish, suggest, keep, practise, risk, consider, admit, deny, miss, imagine, postpone</b>.</p><p>«I <b>enjoy chatting</b> online.» «She <b>avoids posting</b> photos.» «He <b>kept scrolling</b> all night.» «Do you <b>mind waiting</b>?»</p><p>Predlogdan keyin ham doim V-ing: «I’m interested <b>in learning</b>.» «She’s good <b>at editing</b> videos.» «<b>Before leaving</b>, log out.» <b class="rd">look forward to</b> + V-ing: «I look forward to <b>hearing</b> from you.»</p>',
