      x: '<p>Bu fe’llardan keyin <b class="rd">to + V</b>: <b>decide, hope, plan, want, need, manage, afford, refuse, promise, offer, learn, seem, expect, agree</b>.</p><p>«I <b>decided to delete</b> my account.» «She <b>refused to share</b> her password.» «We <b>can’t afford to buy</b> a new phone.»</p><p>Shaxsli: <b>want / ask / tell / expect + shaxs + to V</b>: «I <b>want you to follow</b> me.» Sifatdan keyin ham: «It’s <b>easy to use</b>», «I’m <b>happy to help</b>». Maqsad: «I use it <b>to</b> keep in touch.»</p>',
