    ex: [['She is a quiet and ___ girl. (kamgap)', 'reserved'], ['A strong ___ connects the two sisters. (rishta)', 'bond'], ['He ___ his friend’s trust. (xiyonat qildi)', 'betrayed'], ['You can always ___ me when you need help. (tayanmoq)', 'rely on'], ['Their ___ lasted for forty years. (do‘stlik)', 'friendship'], ['They fell out but later ___ . (yarashdi)', 'made up']]
