      x: '<p><b class="rd">a / an</b> kasb va rol oldidan: «She is <b>a</b> geographer.» Sanoq: <b>a</b> hundred, <b>a</b> thousand, <b>a</b> few, <b>a</b> little.</p><p><b class="rd">Artiklsiz</b> qotib qolgan iboralar (asosiy maqsad): <b>go to school</b> (o‘qishga), <b>go to bed</b> (uxlashga), <b>be in hospital</b> (davolanishda), <b>go to church</b>. Agar <b>bino</b> yoki boshqa maqsad bo‘lsa — <b>the</b>: «I went to <b>the</b> school to meet the teacher.»</p><p>Ovqat nomlari: <b>have breakfast / lunch</b> (artiklsiz), <b>have a big breakfast</b> (sifat bilan — a).</p>',
