    a: [['Namuna', 'Last night we went to a small restaurant. There were a few tables, and nobody was waiting. We ordered several dishes, and everything was delicious. The soup was hot enough, but it had too much salt. There was plenty of bread. I didn’t eat anything sweet, but my friend asked for something special. Would you like some dessert?']],
