    a: [['Namuna', 'I wake up at six and get up at once. After work I wind down with a book, but I often nod off. At the weekend I look after my little brother, and last week I ran into an old friend. We called off our plans, but we’re going to catch up soon. I look forward to meeting her again, and I can’t put up with long delays.']],
