    plan: ['Ertalab (wake up, get up)', 'Ish yoki o‘qish (fill in, hand in)', 'Boshqalar bilan (look after, run into)', 'Muammo (run out of, put up with)', 'Kechqurun (wind down, nod off)'],
    model: 'I wake up at six and get up at once. I turn off the alarm and have breakfast. At school I fill in forms and hand in my homework. After lessons I look after my little sister. Yesterday I ran into an old friend, and we hung out in a café. We ran out of time, so we called off the plan for the cinema. In the evening I wind down with a book, but I often nod off. I look forward to the weekend.',
    c: [['phrasal verbs', '\\b(wake up|get up|turn off|turn on|look after|run out of|put up with|look forward to|wind down|nod off|hang out|drop in|run into|fill in|hand in|call off|give up|take off)\\b', 4], ['separable with pronoun', '\\b(turn|called|filled|gave|put|threw|handed)\\s+(it|them|him|her)\\s+(off|in|up|away|out)\\b', 0], ['look forward to + ing', '\\blook(ing)? forward to\\s+\\w+', 1]],
