    a: [['Namuna', 'Our region was hit by a storm last week. The cause of the damage was strong wind and heavy rain. I am afraid of thunderstorms and worried about floods. The effect on farmers was huge: crops suffered from water. We were warned about the storm and prepared for it. Now the town is recovering from the damage.']],
