    a: [['Namuna', 'My favourite novel is about friendship. It was so gripping that I read it in one night. It was such a moving story that I cried at the end. Some chapters were too long for me to enjoy, but the characters were interesting enough to keep me reading. I would recommend it to anyone who loves a good plot.']],
