      ['Bashorat', '*I think … will* + V', 'I think robots will help us at home.', 'Menimcha, robotlar uyda bizga yordam beradi.'],
      ['Muddat', '*By* + payt + *will have* + V3', 'By 2040 we will have colonised Mars.', '2040-yilga kelib Marsni o‘zlashtirgan bo‘lamiz.'],
      ['Vaqt gapi', '*when / as soon as* + Present', 'As soon as I finish school, I’ll apply to university.', 'Maktabni bitirishim bilan universitetga hujjat topshiraman.']
