    plan: ['Qiyos (more … than)', 'Farq (much / slightly)', 'Proporsional (the more …)', 'So / such', 'Too / enough'],
    model: 'Theft is less serious than violent crime, but it is still a problem. Crime is much lower in our town than ten years ago. The more police patrol the streets, the safer people feel. It was such a shocking case that everyone talked about it. Some fines are too low to stop criminals, and the law must be strict enough to protect citizens.',
