      ['Taqiq / shart emas', '*mustn’t / don’t have to*', 'You mustn’t skip breakfast, but you don’t have to run.', 'Nonushtani tashlab ketmaslik kerak, lekin yugurish shart emas.'],
      ['Taxmin', '*must / might / can’t (have)*', 'He must have trained hard; he can’t be tired.', 'U qattiq mashq qilgan bo‘lsa kerak.']
