      ['knowledge', '/ˈnɒlɪdʒ/', 'bilim', 'Reading increases your *knowledge*.', 'O‘qish bilimingizni oshiradi.', 'brain', 'sanalmaydi: ✗ knowledges, ✗ a knowledge. *gain / have* knowledge *of / about*. Fe’l: know.'],
      ['skill', '/skɪl/', 'ko‘nikma', 'Typing is a useful *skill*.', 'Tez yozish foydali ko‘nikma.', 'hammer-and-wrench', 'sanaladigan: a skill / skills. *develop / acquire* a skill. Sifat: *skilled* (malakali).'],
      ['degree', '/dɪˈɡriː/', 'ilmiy daraja (bakalavr)', 'She has a *degree* in law.', 'U huquq bo‘yicha diplomga ega.', 'graduation-cap', 'universitet darajasi: a degree *in* + fan. *get / do / take* a degree. ≠ diploma, certificate.'],
      ['qualification', '/ˌkwɒlɪfɪˈkeɪʃn/', 'malaka, malaka belgisi', 'You need a *qualification* to teach.', 'O‘qitish uchun malaka kerak.', 'scroll', 'sanaladigan: *qualifications*. *have / gain* qualifications. Fe’l: qualify *as / for*.'],
      ['curriculum', '/kəˈrɪkjələm/', 'o‘quv dasturi', 'The *curriculum* includes science.', 'O‘quv dasturiga fan kiradi.', 'books', 'ko‘plik: curricula / curriculums. *national curriculum*. ≠ syllabus (kurs mazmuni).'],
      ['tuition', '/tjuˈɪʃn/', 'o‘qish haqi, dars berish', 'The *tuition* fees are high.', 'O‘qish haqi baland.', 'money-bag', 'sanalmaydi: *tuition fees*. Individual dars = private tuition.']
