      ['catch up', '/kætʃ ʌp/', 'orqada qolganni yetmoq', 'I must *catch up* on my reading.', 'Men o‘qishni yetib olishim kerak.', 'person-running', 'catch up *on* (ish) / catch up *with* (odam). Ob’ektsiz.'],
      ['go over', '/ɡəʊ ˈəʊvə/', 'takrorlamoq, ko‘rib chiqmoq', 'Let’s *go over* the notes.', 'Qaydlarni takrorlaylik.', 'memo', 'ajratilmaydi: go over + ot. Sinonim: review.'],
      ['hand in', '/hænd ɪn/', 'topshirmoq', '*Hand in* your essays on Friday.', 'Insholaringizni juma kuni topshiring.', 'page-facing-up', 'ko‘chma: hand *it* in. = submit. Ot: *hand-in*.'],
      ['pick up', '/pɪk ʌp/', 'o‘rganib olmoq (tasodifan)', 'She *picked up* French in Paris.', 'U Parijda fransuzchani o‘rganib oldi.', 'speech-balloon', 'tasodifan, qasd qilmasdan o‘rganish: pick up a language. Ko‘chma.']
