      ['peer review', '/pɪə rɪˈvjuː/', 'tengdoshlar tekshiruvi', 'Papers go through *peer review*.', 'Maqolalar tengdoshlar tekshiruvidan o‘tadi.', 'magnifying-glass-tilted-left', 'sanalmaydi: through peer review. Ilmiy nashrlarda.'],
      ['distance learning', '/ˈdɪstəns ˈlɜːnɪŋ/', 'masofaviy ta’lim', '*Distance learning* is growing.', 'Masofaviy ta’lim o‘smoqda.', 'laptop', 'sanalmaydi: *distance learning* / e-learning. Predlog: through / by distance learning.']
