      ['extreme weather', '/ɪkˈstriːm ˈweðə/', 'ekstremal ob-havo', '*Extreme weather* is becoming common.', 'Ekstremal ob-havo odatiy bo‘lib bormoqda.', 'tornado', 'sanalmaydi: extreme weather / temperatures; ✗ extreme weathers.']
