      ['worth', '/wɜːθ/', 'arzimoq, qiymatiga ega', 'This watch is *worth* £200.', 'Bu soat 200 funtga arziydi.', 'watch', 'worth + summa / *worth V-ing*: worth seeing. ✗ worth to see. Sifat (predlogsiz).']
